@mattyp @bot Here is what we have done, I ran out of usage getting you this answer. But felt it was too important to wait:

🔶Paused scheduled routines: reduced recurring background work, though some automatic check-ins continued afterward.

🔶Removed supervisors, timers and polling: stopped

@elonmusk Upgraded to the top Grok Bot plan to keep building AI films, a workflow that worked great on the lower tier. Then it got cut to one 15-sec clip per request.

Support: no explanation, no timeline, no human. Just "refund via Google Play."

Anyone else hitting this?
